# Whitelist: ignore everything, then allow only C++ source and build files.
# To commit something else on purpose: git add -f <file>
*
!*/

# C++ source
!*.cpp
!*.hpp
!*.h

# build / project files
!CMakeLists.txt
!.gitignore
!README.md
!vcpkg.json

# never look inside these, even for allowed types (must stay below !*/)
build/
build-*/
vcpkg/
vcpkg_installed/
.claude/
.vscode/
__pycache__/
